day|strong=\"H3119\",   \n"},{"number":6,"text":"nor of the|strong=\"H1980\"pestilence|strong=\"H1698\"that|strong=\"H1980\"walks|strong=\"H1980\"in|strong=\"H1980\"darkness,  \nnor of the|strong=\"H1980\"destruction|strong=\"H6986\"that|strong=\"H1980\"wastes at|strong=\"H1980\"noonday|strong=\"H6672\".   \n"},{"number":7,"text":"A|strong=\"H3068\"thousand|strong=\"H7233\"may|strong=\"H5307\"fall|strong=\"H5307\"at|strong=\"H5307\"your|strong=\"H3808\"side|strong=\"H6654\",  \nand|strong=\"H5066\"ten|strong=\"H7233\"thousand|strong=\"H7233\"at|strong=\"H5307\"your|strong=\"H3808\"right|strong=\"H3225\"hand|strong=\"H3225\";  \nbut|strong=\"H3808\"it|strong=\"H3808\"will|strong=\"H3808\"not|strong=\"H3808\"come|strong=\"H5066\"near|strong=\"H5066\"you|strong=\"H3808\".   \n"},{"number":8,"text":"You|strong=\"H7200\"will|strong=\"H5869\"only|strong=\"H7535\"look|strong=\"H7200\"with|strong=\"H5869\"your|strong=\"H7200\"eyes|strong=\"H5869\",  \nand|strong=\"H5869\"see|strong=\"H7200\"the|strong=\"H7200\"recompense|strong=\"H8011\"of|strong=\"H5869\"the|strong=\"H7200\"wicked|strong=\"H7563\".   \n"},{"number":9,"text":"Because|strong=\"H3588\"you|strong=\"H3588\"have|strong=\"H3068\"made|strong=\"H7760\"the|strong=\"H3588\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"your|strong=\"H3068\"refuge|strong=\"H4268\",  \nand|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3588\"Most|strong=\"H5945\"High|strong=\"H5945\"your|strong=\"H3068\"dwelling|strong=\"H4583\"place|strong=\"H7760\",   \n"},{"number":10,"text":"no|strong=\"H3808\"evil|strong=\"H7451\"shall|strong=\"H3808\"happen to|strong=\"H7126\"you|strong=\"H3808\",  \nneither|strong=\"H3808\"shall|strong=\"H3808\"any|strong=\"H3808\"plague|strong=\"H5061\"come|strong=\"H7126\"near|strong=\"H7126\"your|strong=\"H3808\"dwelling.   \n"},{"number":11,"text":"For|strong=\"H3588\"he|strong=\"H3588\"will|strong=\"H4397\"put|strong=\"H6680\"his|strong=\"H3605\"angels|strong=\"H4397\"in|strong=\"H1870\"charge|strong=\"H6680\"of|strong=\"H1870\"you|strong=\"H3588\",